#: ../command-line.rst:3 8f9ed3b26d614a50adb2a47f7f354429
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "Línea de comandos"

#: ../command-line.rst:7 a305477abe4b42b4a107af14a8dee2fd
msgid ""
"Galette now proposes a command line interface to manage some tasks. This is "
"accessible through the ``bin/console`` script in Galette root directory:"
msgstr ""
"Galette ahora propone una interfaz de línea de comandos para administrar "
"algunas tareas. Se puede acceder a ella a través del script ``bin/console`` "
"en el directorio raíz de Galette:"

#: ../command-line.rst:38 a5dfed8a283744b7a993ff80f8f17a2d
msgid ""
"You can obtain help for a specific command by using the ``help`` command:"
msgstr ""
"Puedes obtener ayuda para un comando específico utilizando el comando "
"``help``:"

#: ../command-line.rst:41 a6a97905330747e391f328ad817f32a8
msgid "Check"
msgstr "Marcar"

#: ../command-line.rst:43 9724d7450869485e968fc5eaa756512a
msgid ""
"This only check for Galette prerequisites, and has no specific arguments."
msgstr ""
"Solo comprueba los requisitos previos de Galette y no tiene argumentos "
"específicos."

#: ../command-line.rst:47 f72cddbb5d2a42ad9927bb0b890c917f
msgid ""
"On some systems, PHP configuration may differ between cli and web; therefore "
"it's recommended to check for requirements from the web script "
"``galette_compat.php``."
msgstr ""
"En algunos sistemas, la configuración de PHP puede diferir entre la CLI y la "
"web; por lo tanto, se recomienda verificar los requisitos en el script web "
"``galette_compat.php``."

#: ../command-line.rst:50 470facad68f645dab1b5f885a865fc30
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Install"

#: ../command-line.rst:52 1b992cceb8d74d42b3c7a8f64f4c5ec2
msgid "This command obviously installs Galette :)"
msgstr "Este comando obviamente instala Galette :)"

#: ../command-line.rst:81 beb4a03a5b1c4b74a924fa278587ae6a
msgid ""
"By default, the script will check for an existing configuration file, you "
"can ignore that using the ``--ignore-config`` option."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, el script buscará un archivo de configuración "
"existente; puede ignorarlo utilizando la opción ``--ignore-config``."

#: ../command-line.rst:83 00aa795fe15349eaa4caf121cd5a73a2
msgid ""
"Required options that have not been provided on script call will be asked "
"interactively."
msgstr ""
"Las opciones requeridas que no se hayan proporcionado en la llamada de "
"script se preguntarán de forma interactiva."

#: ../command-line.rst:131 d81d6e22c1aa4bf08a96a867fcd06d7f
msgid "Super administrator password"
msgstr ""

#: ../command-line.rst:135 e8ba82180024400f8c8acf2499eaa577
msgid ""
"The super administrator password is normally changed from "
"the :ref:`preferences <man_preferences>`, or from the :ref:`advanced "
"configuration <advanced_config>` page. Both require to be logged in, which "
"is of little help the day the password is lost: the super administrator is "
"not a member, so it cannot use the *forgotten password* form either."
msgstr ""

#: ../command-line.rst:137 4bbd06f1b7954ff48ff796efb0d8b31f
msgid ""
"This command is the way back in. It runs on the machine hosting Galette, and "
"that access stands as the authentication."
msgstr ""

#: ../command-line.rst:157 a760cf598fed48b5b374a6b74b84d760
msgid ""
"There is no option to pass the password with: it is only ever read from a "
"hidden prompt, so that it does not end up in your shell history nor in the "
"process list of the machine. It is asked twice, and the two answers must "
"match."
msgstr ""

#: ../command-line.rst:176 46d0d0aa9b0f46bcbdc79fa91979def9
msgid ""
"The login is displayed so you know which account you just changed, but the "
"command does not touch it. Change it from the preferences, as usual."
msgstr ""

#: ../command-line.rst:178 f1126021f9dd4edaad61144127cf3822
msgid ""
"The new password must satisfy the :ref:`password rules <password_rules>` of "
"your instance, exactly as it would from the preferences page: too short a "
"password, or one that does not reach the required strength, is refused and "
"nothing is stored."
msgstr ""

#: ../command-line.rst:182 54c2e4cbbc9e405e95662ca06eb30510
msgid ""
"A terminal is needed. Called with ``--no-interaction``, or with its input "
"piped from a file or another command, the command refuses to run rather than "
"silently doing nothing."
msgstr ""

#: ../command-line.rst:186 9efd3ff9b3164b139b51ca3dbbaa7dae
msgid ""
"The command is disabled when Galette runs in ``DEMO`` :ref:`mode "
"<galettemodes>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../command-line.rst:189 e5a534ee93f2455cbfe77e9b909d2e69
msgid "Plugins commands"
msgstr "Comandos de los plugins"

#: ../command-line.rst:191 d182d59314d34ef0816b3476ddec6a72
msgid ""
"You can list existing plugins using the ``galette:plugins:list`` command:"
msgstr ""
"Puede enumerar los plugins existentes utilizando el comando "
"``galette:plugins:list``:"

#: ../command-line.rst:208 0d4a5cc4c21d4508b14ee5a421465bee
msgid "Available commands are:"
msgstr "Los comandos disponibles son:"

#: ../command-line.rst:210 b595b93437d44a4fb6422e84b83a3d9d
msgid "``galette:plugin:disable``: disable a plugin"
msgstr "``galette:plugin:disable``: desactivar un plugin"

#: ../command-line.rst:211 14709c8ffa8144448bb0358432865fd0
msgid "``galette:plugin:enable``: enable a plugin"
msgstr "``galette:plugin:enable``: activar un plugin"

#: ../command-line.rst:212 95a58ea06f37496c9b67c230f3fcdc9d
msgid "``galette:plugin:install-db``: install a plugin database"
msgstr "``galette:plugin:install-db``: instala la base de datos de un plugin"

#: ../command-line.rst:216 b55fc84401f4420da76afe788847f8d0
msgid "Plugin database installation will remove any existing plugin tables!"
msgstr ""
"¡La instalación de la base de datos del plugin borrará todas las tablas "
"existentes para este plugin!"

#: ../command-line.rst:218 0baf640124624bec8e84439b3604cde5
msgid ""
"For every plugin related command, you can precise which plugin(s) you want "
"to act on, use the ``--all`` flag or either rely on interactive mode:"
msgstr ""
"Para cada comando relacionado con el complemento, puede especificar sobre "
"qué complemento(s) desea actuar, usar el indicador ``--all`` o confiar en el "
"modo interactivo:"
